-- Illustrative cost assumption, adjustable with a slicer.
-- Modeling > New parameter > Numeric range:
--   Name: Cost per Contact   Data type: Decimal number   Minimum: 1   Maximum: 20   Increment: 0.5   Default: 5
--   Tick "Add slicer to this page".
-- Power BI then creates a table and this measure automatically (shown here so you can check it):
Cost per Contact = GENERATESERIES ( 1, 20, 0.5 )
Cost per Contact Value = SELECTEDVALUE ( 'Cost per Contact'[Cost per Contact], 5 )
